### ===== CREATE TEST ACCOUNTS =====

### Register testuser01
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser01",
  "email": "testuser01@test.com",
  "password": "Test1234!@#$",
  "passwordConfirm": "Test1234!@#$"
}

