### ===== LOGINS =====

### Login testuser01
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "testuser01",
  "password": "Test1234!@#$"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token1", response.body.access_token);
%}

