### ===== SETUP PROFILS =====

### testuser01 - bio public, musicpref friends-only
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "Fan de rap et de rock, organisateur de soirées musicales",
  "musicpreferences": ["rap", "rock", "electro"],
  "visibilitySettings": {
    "bio": "public",
    "musicPreferences": "friends-only"
  }
}

### testuser02 - tout private
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "Bio secrète de testuser02",
  "musicpreferences": ["jazz", "classical"],
  "visibilitySettings": {
    "bio": "private",
    "musicPreferences": "private"
  }
}

### testuser03 - tout public
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token3}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "Bio publique de testuser03",
  "musicpreferences": ["reggae", "rnb"],
  "visibilitySettings": {
    "bio": "public",
    "musicPreferences": "public"
  }
}

### testuser04 - tout friends-only
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token4}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "Bio réservée aux amis de testuser04",
  "musicpreferences": ["metal", "country"],
  "visibilitySettings": {
    "bio": "friends-only",
    "musicPreferences": "friends-only"
  }
}


### ===== VÉRIFICATION IDS =====

### Get id testuser01
GET http://localhost:3000/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}

> {%
    client.global.set("id1", response.body.id);
%}

